{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675290/extras/9656a4e462a948cf04bdd4a89cfa4509.avif?t=1763982876\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystal Gaiden Origins</strong> is a side-scrolling action platformer with a bold 8-bit aesthetic, pulsing chiptunes, and razor-sharp gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a rogue warrior fighting through burning cities, buried ruins, high-tech research facilities, and an active orbital elevator primed to unleash a doomsday weapon \u2014 all in a collapsing sci-fi world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through rebel strongholds with advanced weaponry, and strike down your former brothers in the imperial army using forbidden powers buried in the past \u2014 all while uncovering a conspiracy that threatens the one you love. Trigger a berserk system that boosts your strength at the cost of your own health \u2014 every strike a sacrifice to bring her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the 80s\u201390s era of NES action platformers \u2014 from Ninja Gaiden and Shatterhand to Castlevania and Shadow of the Ninja.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-bit graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling Action Platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Sub Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ types of enemies</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wrecked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675290/147e0628ce95ca01360a25f050e5dd0204f0b25f.jpg"},{"name":"Defused","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3675290/58e9542e947e430e